    "detailed_description": "<strong>Cemetery of Bob</strong> is a challenging roguelike auto-battler focused on tactical aspect of gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit your army of undead</strong></h2>Choose between dead creatures and make them fight for your cause. Every character has unique abilities that can be activated by putting it in front or in back of the lane. Undead have both strengths and weaknesses, which encourages you to look for synergies. Use your strengths and overcome your weaknesses to secure victory over Bob.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/6775113cb684cbafc1190f6a2928f8ce.poster.avif?t=1727860340\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/6775113cb684cbafc1190f6a2928f8ce.webm?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/6775113cb684cbafc1190f6a2928f8ce.mp4?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend cemetery from your opponents</strong></h2>Fight against mythical creatures and army of humans. Opponent and place are very important in this game. Your cemetery is divided into 3 lanes where combat takes place at the same time. Gather knowledge about your opponent to know which undead can deal with him. Depending on which lanes you win, you will earn the appropriate currency.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/c5571ab964f66774b76d25c51c6bb757.poster.avif?t=1727860340\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/c5571ab964f66774b76d25c51c6bb757.webm?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/c5571ab964f66774b76d25c51c6bb757.mp4?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your army</strong></h2><strong>Need undead for your army ?</strong> Buy new one at Zero's shop for bones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/6b395892c9ca73ae86a8b86b3f8aef13.poster.avif?t=1727860340\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/6b395892c9ca73ae86a8b86b3f8aef13.webm?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/6b395892c9ca73ae86a8b86b3f8aef13.mp4?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Do you need to level up your undead ?</strong> You can do this at Elizabeth's shop for some blood.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/d64cf242566ddb4cb894c05df05ac284.poster.avif?t=1727860340\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/d64cf242566ddb4cb894c05df05ac284.webm?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/d64cf242566ddb4cb894c05df05ac284.mp4?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Or maybe you lack of items ?</strong> Visit Charon, he always has something shiny to buy with coins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/b82309545520979b2459fef6401fd898.poster.avif?t=1727860340\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/b82309545520979b2459fef6401fd898.webm?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/b82309545520979b2459fef6401fd898.mp4?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Just be careful about Bob... Bob is watching your every move and he doesn't like what you're doing. He wants take over the cemetery. He's so cheeky that he's even in the title of this game... He even claims that it's his graveyard. The audacity of this guy...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/594447ccdc32e3036a56cbdcf1e13d1f.poster.avif?t=1727860340\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/594447ccdc32e3036a56cbdcf1e13d1f.webm?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/594447ccdc32e3036a56cbdcf1e13d1f.mp4?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight against randomly generated enemies<br></li><li>Choose beetween many unique characters to build your army of undead<br></li><li>Find synergy between undead and items<br></li><li>Defeat Bob</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Cemetery of Bob</strong> is a challenging roguelike auto-battler focused on tactical aspect of gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit your army of undead</strong></h2>Choose between dead creatures and make them fight for your cause. Every character has unique abilities that can be activated by putting it in front or in back of the lane. Undead have both strengths and weaknesses, which encourages you to look for synergies. Use your strengths and overcome your weaknesses to secure victory over Bob.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/6775113cb684cbafc1190f6a2928f8ce.poster.avif?t=1727860340\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/6775113cb684cbafc1190f6a2928f8ce.webm?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/6775113cb684cbafc1190f6a2928f8ce.mp4?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend cemetery from your opponents</strong></h2>Fight against mythical creatures and army of humans. Opponent and place are very important in this game. Your cemetery is divided into 3 lanes where combat takes place at the same time. Gather knowledge about your opponent to know which undead can deal with him. Depending on which lanes you win, you will earn the appropriate currency.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/c5571ab964f66774b76d25c51c6bb757.poster.avif?t=1727860340\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813240/extras/c5571ab964f66774b76d25c51c6bb757.webm?t=1727860340\" type=\"video/